### Reading data from Students Table
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/student-api/StudentSet

### Creating record in Students Table
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/student-api/StudentSet
Content-Type: application/json

{
      "name": "Krishiv",
      "address": "Pune",
      "email": "krn@gmail.com",
      "mobile": "8087438399",
      "age": 1,
      "gender": "Male"
}

### Update Data
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/student-api/StudentSet('a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5')
Content-Type: application/json

 {
      "email": "evika@gmail.com"
    }

### Delete Data
DELETE  http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/student-api/StudentSet('a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5')
### Reading data from Authors Table
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/student-api/Authors
### Creating record in Authors Table
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/student-api/Authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
      "name": "Ganesh Narute",
      "books": [
            {
              "name": "SAP Learn",
              "title": "BTP CAPM",
              "publishedDate": "10-10-2020"
            },
              {
              "name": "SAP Learn2",
              "title": "BTP CAPM2",
              "publishedDate":  "11-11-2020"
            }
            ]
      
}